    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-97" id="fn-97" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Corporate administrative services are allocated to UGI Utilities and other business units of UGI Corporation based primarily on an Modified Wisconsin Formula (&#8220;MWF&#8221;).&#160; This formula measures the relative size of the business units which receive the services.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-98" id="fn-98" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Insurance expenses are allocated to UGI Utilities and other business units of UGI Corporation based on the underlying cost of the insurable interest, using underwriting costs provided by the insurance providers.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-99" id="fn-99" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Labor and Benefits costs are allocated by UGI Corporation to UGI Utilities based on the time spent by UGI Corporation employees directly on UGI Utilities matters.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-100" id="fn-100" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">IT costs are allocated by UGI Amerigas to UGI Utilities based on their portion of the total number of licensed users for the relevant software.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-101" id="fn-101" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">401k savings plan costs are charged to affiliates based on the actual costs for contributions on behalf of the employees who are employed by the affiliates.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-102" id="fn-102" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">401k savings plan costs are charged to affiliates based on the actual costs for contributions on behalf of the employees who are employed by the affiliates.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-103" id="fn-103" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Insurance expenses are allocated to UGI Utilities and other business units of UGI Corporation based on the underlying cost of the insurable interest, using underwriting costs provided by the insurance providers.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-104" id="fn-104" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Insurance expenses are allocated to UGI Utilities and other business units of UGI Corporation based on the underlying cost of the insurable interest, using underwriting costs provided by the insurance providers.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-105" id="fn-105" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Labor and benefits costs are charged to affiliates based on an estimate of the time that Utilities employees devote to providing services to these affiliates.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-106" id="fn-106" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Labor and benefits costs are charged to affiliates based on an estimate of the time that Utilities employees devote to providing services to these affiliates.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-107" id="fn-107" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Labor and benefits costs are charged to affiliates based on an estimate of the time that Utilities employees devote to providing services to these affiliates.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-108" id="fn-108" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">IT costs are allocated to UGI Corp based on their portion of the total number of licensed users for the relevant software.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-109" id="fn-109" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">IT costs are allocated to UGI Energy Services based on their portion of the total number of licensed users for the relevant software.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-110" id="fn-110" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">IT costs are allocated to UGI Mountaineer based on their portion of the total number of licensed users for the relevant software.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-111" id="fn-111" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">IT costs are allocated to UGI Central Gas Control based on their portion of the total number of licensed users for the relevant software.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-112" id="fn-112" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">N/A</link:footnote>
